  "notes": "{電気|でんき} means both 'electricity' as a power source and 'electric light' in everyday usage.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {電気|でんき}を{付|つ}ける (turn on the lights)\n- {電気|でんき}を{消|け}す (turn off the lights)\n- {電気|でんき}が{止|と}まる (power outage)\n- {電気代|でんきだい} (electricity bill)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {電力|でんりょく}: electric power\n- {停電|ていでん}: power outage\n- {電気製品|でんきせいひん}: electrical appliances\n\nNOTE: Do not confuse with {伝記|でんき} (biography), which has the same reading.",
